  "question": {
    "text": "A triangle is formed by the tangents at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;on the curves <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math>, and the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math> is the radius of its circumcircle, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is common point on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is tangent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>And,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is tangent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>And,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d89649bc-0f91-4888-84de-e4598f9bc3ac-9895166.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 305px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>20</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>8</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ar</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ar</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ar</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#916;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>160</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p>",
